    "description": "<p>A Power Recharger is used to recharge a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Energy_Cell\" title=\"Energy Cell\">Energy Cell</a>. The recharge process takes 4 hours, and only one <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Energy_Cell\" title=\"Energy Cell\">Energy Cell</a> may be recharged at a time. A Power Recharger holds enough power to recharge 100 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Packs</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Energy_Cell\" title=\"Energy Cell\">Energy Cells</a>, but is normally connected to a ship's or building's power supply, allowing it unlimited recharge capacity. </p>",
